  "solution": "Given equation: 28 A 14 A 12 A 6 A 4 A 3 A 4\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) +, ̶ , ÷, ×, =, + \n\nGiven: 28 A 14 A 12 A 6 A 4 A 3 A 4 \n\nAfter replace the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 28 +14 - **12 ÷ 6** × 4 = 3 + 4 \n\n⇒ 28 +14 - __2____ **× 4**__ = 3 + 4 \n\n⇒ __**28 +14**__ - 8 = __**3 + 4**____** **__\n\n⇒ **__42-8 __** = 7\n\n⇒ 34 ≠ 7\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) ̶ , +, ×, =, ÷, +\n\nGiven: 28 A 14 A 12 A 6 A 4 A 3 A 4\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 28 - 14 + 12 × 6 = __**4 ÷ 3**__ + 4\n\n⇒ 28 - 14 + **12 ****×**** 6** = 1.33 + 4\n\n⇒ __**28**__ - 14 __**+ 72 **__= __**1.33**____** + 4**__\n\n⇒ **__100 - 14__ **= 5.33\n\n⇒ 86 ≠ 5.33\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ** ̶ , +, ÷, =, ×, +**\n\nGiven: 28 A 14 A 12 A 6 A 4 A 3 A 4\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 28 - 14 + __**12 ÷ 6**__ = 4 × 3 + 4\n\n⇒ 28 - 14 + 2 = __**4 **____**×**____** 3**__ + 4\n\n⇒ 28 - 14 + 2 = 12 + 4\n\n⇒ __**28**__ - 14 __**+ 2**__ = __**12**____** + 4**__\n\n⇒ __30 - 14__ = 16\n\n⇒ 16 = 16\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) ̶ , +, ÷, ×, =, +\n\nGiven: 28 A 14 A 12 A 6 A 4 A 3 A 4\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 8 - 14 + __**12 ÷ 6**__ × 4 = 3 + 4\n\n⇒ 8 - 14 + __**2**____** ×**____** 4**__ = 3 + 4\n\n⇒ __**8**__ - 14 __**+ 8**__ = __**3 **____**+ 4**__\n\n⇒ **__16 - 14__** = 7\n\n⇒ 2 ≠ 7\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".\n\n60",
